{"script":"s_1_4_0","des":"契约者探索队","exps":[{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_1"}},{"key":"top","para":{"layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"setLayer","para":{"noIn":false,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","alpha":0,"x":450,"img":"chara004_1","y":-204,"mirrow":false,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d"}},{"key":"moveLayer","para":{"transTime":300,"noIn":false,"bright":1,"layer":"chara2","alpha":1,"x":450,"img":"chara004_1","y":-204,"mirrow":false,"scaleX":1,"trans":true,"noOut":false,"scaleY":1,"addImg":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d"}},{"key":"wait","para":{"time":300}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]嗯～其实也没什么大事啦……[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]之前，在你们收复黑铁煅炉和修行所周边后……驿站终于找回了一些早已失联的探索队的消息。[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_16"}},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"y":-50,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":270,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"x":0},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":320,"type":""},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"y":50,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":270,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"x":0},"key":"moveLayer"},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_3"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]在这种程度的异变影响之下……大多数探索队果然都有去无回了……[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_4"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1b","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]所以，我只是来看看你和小野猫的状况，[r]提醒你们就算是自己带队组建探索队，也一定要慎之又慎——[l]"}},{"key":"option","para":{"options":[{"text":"谢谢你，艾尔莎……","tag":"tag_5"},{"text":"可是，“探索队”究竟是什么？","tag":"tag_5"}]}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_5"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1c","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show][cm]咦！对哦，你应该还不知道探索队是什么来着……[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_14"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1b","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]自从大兽潮后，我们大量的村庄失守，许多曾经的聚居地现在都落入魔物之手。[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_6"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1a","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]探索队便是一种以探索这些沦陷区域为目的而组建成的契约者小队。[r]为了保证探索途中的安全，队伍必须以四名契约者为标准组成。[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_13"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]探索队将遍历整个区域，探索失落的地区，清剿游荡的敌人，[r]收回大兽潮时散落的物资，是我们驿站很重要的安防手段和补给来源。[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_8"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]只是，这样一次探索需要的时间是很长的。之前那些失联的探索队，[r]可能就是在远征的途中遇上了异变影响的魔物，才导致的悲剧。[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_9"}},{"key":"event","para":{"eventData":"{\r  \"para\": {\r    \"bubbles\": {\r      \"chara004_1\": \"01\"\r    }\r  },\r  \"action\": \"bubble\"\r}","event":"GAoEvent"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1c","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]哎？你说……既然因为你们的活跃，异变的影响已经缩小……所以你也想试着组建探索队？[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_18"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1d","layer":"chara2"}},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":50,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"x":-25},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":50,"type":""},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":100,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"x":45},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":100,"type":""},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":80,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"x":-40},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":80,"type":""},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":60,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"x":30},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":60,"type":""},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":40,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"x":-20},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":40,"type":""},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":30,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"x":15},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":30,"type":""},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"alpha":1,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":10,"y":0,"scaleY":1,"x":-5},"key":"moveLayer"},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_10"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]呜，这话虽然也没错……但我本来是想好心好意提醒你们不要贸然涉险的，这不是起了反效果吗……[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_11"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]你说你们会照顾好自己，而且驿站也需要更多的探索队……唉，这话倒是不假……[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_15"}},{"key":"setLayerFace","para":{"img":"chara004_1_face_chara004_1b","layer":"chara2"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]但你们要答应我，一定要认真阅读驿站发布的探索队指南，千万不要出什么意外！[l][cm]"}},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_17"}},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"y":30,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":100,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"x":0},"key":"moveLayer"},{"para":{"time":100,"type":""},"key":"wait"},{"para":{"relativePos":true,"y":-30,"bright":1,"scaleX":1,"layer":"chara2","transTime":100,"alpha":1,"scaleY":1,"x":0},"key":"moveLayer"},{"key":"tag","para":{"tag":"tag_12"}},{"key":"text","para":{"charaName":"艾尔莎","nameSide":"left","text":"[show]那……就来试试看吧。将之前在旅途中遇见或者招募到的契约者伙伴，组成探索队，收复失地吧……！[l][cm]"}},{"key":"end","para":{"end":true}}]}